# Crypto Pulse — Conventions (KHACHAPURI.JS)

## Precedence (high → low)
1. `SPRINT_N_CHECKLIST.md` + linked GitHub issue
2. `CODE_STANDARDS.md` / `SPRINT*_CHECKPOINT.md` if present
3. README **Project Notes** / **Deployment** sections
4. This file

## PR checklist
- In scope for current `SPRINT_N_CHECKLIST.md` (no YAGNI)
- `yarn install --frozen-lockfile` · `yarn lint` · `yarn build --configuration production`
- Tick sprint checklist · link `sprint-N` issue · Conventional Commits · no squash on diary PRs

## Architecture [A]
- **[A-01]** UI = display only. Domain logic → `core/services/`. DI via `inject()`.
- **[A-02]** SOLID: S/O/L/I/D. Abstractions via `InjectionToken` / `useExisting`.
- **[A-04]** DRY: shared logic → `shared/utils/` or `core/services/`. Magic values → `core/constants/`.
- **[A-06]** Feature self-contained. Cross-feature exports via `features/<name>/index.ts` only.
- **[A-07]** Import order: `core` ← `shared` ← `features` ← `layout`. Never reverse.

## General [G]
- **[G-01]** `strict: true` + `noImplicitOverride`. No `any`, no `@ts-ignore`. RxJS errors → `unknown`, narrow before use.
- **[G-02]** Max **150 lines** per file. Split if exceeded.
- **[G-03]** `PascalCaseComponent/Service/Pipe/Directive` · `camelCaseGuard/Interceptor` · `kebab-case` files · `SCREAMING_SNAKE_CASE` tokens.
- **[G-04]** Constants: user copy, validation msgs, HTTP paths, `localStorage` keys → `core/constants/*.constants.ts`.
- **[G-05]** Never `console.*`. Use `LoggerService`. HTTP errors → `catchError` + `user-feedback.constants.ts`.
- **[G-06]** Yarn only. Never `npm install` / `npm run`.
- **[G-07]** Conventional Commits. Branch: `feat/<scope>`, `fix/<scope>`. No direct push to `main` (Sprint 2+).
- **[G-08]** Diary files are hand-written. No squash-merge on diary PRs.

## Angular [O]
- **[O-01]** `standalone: true` everywhere. No NgModules.
- **[O-02]** `changeDetection: ChangeDetectionStrategy.OnPush` on every component.
- **[O-03]** State: `signal()` · derived: `computed()` · side effects: `effect()` · writable derived: `linkedSignal()`.
- **[O-04]** `input()` / `input.required()` / `output()` / `model()`. Never `@Input()` / `@Output()`.
- **[O-05]** `@if` / `@for` / `@switch` / `@defer`. Never `*ngIf` / `*ngFor`. `@for` always needs `track`.
- **[O-06]** `inject()` over constructor DI. Constructor only for `effect()` registration.
- **[O-07]** `providedIn: 'root'` by default.
- **[O-08]** Functional guards (`CanActivateFn`, `CanDeactivateFn`) and interceptors (`HttpInterceptorFn`).
- **[O-09]** All shell children use `loadComponent` or `loadChildren`.
- **[O-10]** RxJS stays in services. Components use `toSignal()`. Manual subs → `takeUntilDestroyed()`.
- **[O-11]** Components never call `HttpClient` directly.
- **[O-12]** Every async branch: loading + empty + error states.

## Forms [F]
- **[F-01]** `ReactiveFormsModule` + `NonNullableFormBuilder`. No template-driven forms.
- **[F-02]** ≥2 validators per field (`required` + domain validator).
- **[F-03]** Custom `ValidatorFn` → `core/validators/` or feature-local `validators/`.
- **[F-04]** Inline errors when `touched && invalid`. Strings from `user-feedback.constants.ts`.

## Project-specific [P]
- **[P-01]** No Binance API key. Mock trading via `MockApiService` (`of(...).pipe(delay())`).
- **[P-02]** Real market data: Binance Spot Testnet public endpoints via `MarketDataService`.
- **[P-03]** Portfolio/orders/deposits = `MOCK_*` constants + simulated latency.
- **[P-04]** `WalletService` = reference implementation (signals + computed + effect + RxJS + DI + persistence).
- **[P-05]** RS School logo mandatory on `/about` — clickable, links to `https://rs.school`.
- **[P-06]** Beyond-API trio (wallet connect, price alerts, virtual deposit/withdraw) persist to `localStorage`.
